{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rain's Golf</strong> is a chaotic multiplayer golf game where up to 4 players compete in wild, strategic matches using cards! Master tricky maps, play your cards wisely, and outsmart your friends to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, before the active player takes their shot, the other players secretly cast their cards. Once the golfer decides it\u2019s time to swing, the chaos begins - every hidden card is revealed at once! This means card-casters must predict the golfer\u2019s strategy and shot direction, all while racing against the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team up with up to 3 friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends or make your lobby public and compete with strangers!\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore interesting maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras/c4408ae55ebd03bd7d2b12e7ad9cce87.avif?t=1774208447\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras_big/c4408ae55ebd03bd7d2b12e7ad9cce87.webp?t=1774208447 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has it's own unique obstacles and environment together with many different paths to take while fighting for victory\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore crazy cards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras/90bb907aa805fdc1720fdef490b68e80.poster.avif?t=1774208447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras/90bb907aa805fdc1720fdef490b68e80.webm?t=1774208447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras/90bb907aa805fdc1720fdef490b68e80.mp4?t=1774208447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new cards by playing and track your progress in the card album. Cards are chaotic - ranging from simple brick walls to meteorites, landmines or even piece of <i>ham</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your golf ball!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras/d6de896e50fb4d1f0c110213f9d0b62f.poster.avif?t=1774208447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras/d6de896e50fb4d1f0c110213f9d0b62f.webm?t=1774208447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/extras/d6de896e50fb4d1f0c110213f9d0b62f.mp4?t=1774208447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your golf ball, paint it as you wish with an in-game editor containing plenty of options!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864990?t=1774208447","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864990?t=1774208447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/3893cbd0bbfd2865732959f9709b66c189354284/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774208447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864990/3893cbd0bbfd2865732959f9709b66c189354284/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774208447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"descri